<title>USA: Comarco gets $14.5 million contract.</title>
<headline>Comarco gets $14.5 million contract.</headline>
<dateline>YORBA LINDA, Calif. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comarco Inc Tuesday said it has been awarded a contract valued at $14.5 million to provide engineering support to the U.S. Army Test and Experimentation Command.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the cost-plus-award-fee contract is for a base period of one year, with three one-year options, and it is expected to be completed by Sept. 30, 2000.</p>
</text>
